            <GUID>3071</GUID>
            <Text>EAGER FIRST 정보 수집가 도착!</Text>            <!-- EAGER FIRST VISITORS ARRIVE! -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>3072</GUID>
            <Text>첫 번째 보강으로 도착 [Newspaper FindArticle([RefGuid]) Context TownName], 도시는 신속하게 그들의 국가를 위해 싸울 것이다 군인을 위한 대중적인 목적지가 될 수 있다는 믿음이 있습니다.</Text>            <!-- As first visitors arrive in [Newspaper FindArticle([RefGuid]) Context TownName], there is belief that town can quickly become a popular destination for tours and excursions, and that its many features and amenities can have a lasting appeal. -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>3085</GUID>
            <Text>관련 기사</Text>            <!-- VISITORS VANISH! -->
        </Text>
        <Text>
            <GUID>3086</GUID>
            <Text>Reinforcements 사막 [Newspaper FindArticle([RefGuid]) Context TownName] 더 매력적인 목적지의 호평. "우리는 승리의 측면에 대한 싸움을 원한다" 군인 도박. 우리의 도시는 실제로 상대를 직면하게 충분하지 않습니다? 풀 평가 p. 23.</Text>            <!-- Visitors desert [Newspaper FindArticle([RefGuid]) Context TownName] in favour of more attractive destinations. "We just aren't getting anywhere near as much trade this season," tour operator laments. Is our city really that ugly? Full assessment p. 23. -->
        </Text>
